# 🧠 Anki Generator Pro

> AI-powered Anki flashcard pipeline for medical students and language learners.  
> Turns YouTube lectures and PDF textbooks into high-quality, exam-ready cards — automatically.

---

## What This Is

A personal study tool built by a 4th-year medical student to solve a real problem: **Dr. Najeeb's lectures are 60+ minutes each, and manually making Anki cards from them takes hours**. This pipeline does it in under 15 minutes, using multiple AI providers with automatic failover.

The system is also designed for German language learning (Menschen A1/A2 textbook), generating vocabulary cards with articles, plurals, and cloze deletions.

