## Architecture

```
Source (YouTube URL or PDF path)
        ↓
chunker.py — Smart splitting
  YouTube: pause-based (>2.5s gap = boundary, max 10 min, min 2 min)
  PDF:     heading-based (Kapitel/Chapter/Unit), fallback to paragraphs
        ↓
generator.py — Topic detection + card generation
  Gemini Flash detects topic of each chunk (4-6 words)
  Gemini Flash generates 15-35 Basic + Cloze cards per chunk
        ↓
filter.py — Groq Llama quality filter
  Removes: too vague, trivial, incomplete, broken cards
  Semantic deduplication across all chunks
        ↓
quality.py — Gemini Pro polish
  Adds mnemonics for lists of 3+ items
  Improves vague question phrasing
  Fixes medical inaccuracies silently
        ↓
pipeline.py — Saves to output/ as Anki .txt
  Basic cards  → #notetype:Basic
  Cloze cards  → #notetype:Cloze
```

### AI Provider Fallback

```
Gemini Flash (attempt 1) → wait 15s
Gemini Flash (attempt 2) → wait 30s
Gemini Flash (attempt 3) → switch to fallback
        ↓
NVIDIA Llama 3.3 70B (priority 2)
        ↓
Groq Llama 3.3 70B (priority 3)
        ↓
OpenRouter Llama (priority 4)
```

---

## File Structure

```
C:\анки учеба\
  ├── anki_gen.py      — YouTube transcript fetching + Gemini card generation
  ├── pdf_gen.py       — PDF text extraction + Gemini card generation
  ├── chunker.py       — Smart chunking (YouTube by pauses, PDF by headings)
  ├── generator.py     — Multi-AI orchestrator with fallback logic
  ├── filter.py        — Groq Llama semantic filtering + deduplication
  ├── quality.py       — Gemini Pro quality control + mnemonics
  ├── usage.py         — API quota tracking (resets daily)
  ├── pipeline.py      — Main pipeline connecting all steps
  ├── server.py        — Flask web server
  ├── main.py          — Terminal menu interface
  ├── index.html       — Web UI
  ├── config.json      — API keys + settings
  └── output/          — Generated .txt files ready for Anki import
```

---

## API Keys Used

| Provider                          | Purpose                         | Free Limit    |
| --------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------- |
| Gemini Flash (`gemini_api_key`)   | Card generation (primary)       | 1500 req/day  |
| Gemini Pro (`gemini_pro_key`)     | Quality control + mnemonics     | 50 req/day    |
| Groq (`groq_api_key`)             | Filtering + fallback generation | 14400 req/day |
| NVIDIA NIM (`nvidia_api_key`)     | Fallback when Gemini 503        | 1000 credits  |
| OpenRouter (`openrouter_api_key`) | Last resort fallback            | 200 req/day   |

