## How to Run

```bash
# Web UI (recommended)
python server.py
# Opens http://localhost:5000 automatically

# Terminal menu
python main.py

# Direct pipeline test
python pipeline.py youtube https://youtu.be/VIDEO_ID "Deck Name"
python pipeline.py pdf "C:\path\to\book.pdf" "Deck Name" 11 50
```

**Import to Anki:**

1. File → Import
2. Select the `.txt` file from `output/`
3. Check "Allow HTML in fields"
4. Click Import

